              "allocates each call"
            ],
            [
              "custom struct",
              "callers read fields",
              "one alloc, typed"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`errors.New(text)` is the cheapest error — ideal for sentinels",
            "Declare `var ErrX = errors.New(...)` once at package init",
            "`fmt.Errorf(format, args...)` for contextual detail"
          ]
        },
        {
